Item/Fluid Input for Multiblocks
Contents are always separated with other bus/hatch
Programming Cover function integrated
Patterns are split into 4 groups in column order; the group sizes are set on the config page and the pattern page marks each group with stripes
Publishes balanced patterns: items that are both input and output (seeds/catalysts) come from the seed stock
Seeds used are recovered from this ME network's incoming items (any source)
Outputs must go back into the same ME network
Patterns can be assigned to lanes that send their inputs to bound buffered dual input hatches of other machines
